[
    [
        {
            "type": "doc_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.319,
                0.082,
                0.68,
                0.105
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "2026 届高三数学第五次模拟考试"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.381,
                0.118,
                0.618,
                0.134
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "满分 150 分 考试时间 120 分钟",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.103,
                0.164,
                0.446,
                0.182
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "一、选择题（每小题5分，共40分）"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.103,
                0.198,
                0.727,
                0.244
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "1. 已知集合 \\(A = \\{x \\mid x^2 - 3x + 2 \\leqslant 0\\}\\), \\(B = \\{x \\mid x > 1\\}\\), 则 \\(A \\cap B = A\\) (1, 2) B. [1, 2] C. (1, 2] D. [1, 2)",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.102,
                0.264,
                0.878,
                0.335
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "2. 如图，在正方体 ABCD-A1B1C1D1 中，E 为棱 BB1 的中点，则异面直线 AE 与 CD 所成角的正切值为\nA. \\(\\sqrt{2}/2\\) B. \\(\\sqrt{3}/3\\) C. \\(\\sqrt{5}/5\\) D. \\(2\\sqrt{5}/5\\)",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "image",
            "bbox": [
                0.151,
                0.35,
                0.365,
                0.515
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": null
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.103,
                0.547,
                0.699,
                0.591
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "3. 函数 \\( f(x) = \\sin (2x + \\pi / 3) \\) 的最小正周期为\nA. \\( \\pi / 2 \\) B. \\( \\pi \\) C. \\( 2\\pi \\) D. \\( 4\\pi \\)",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.104,
                0.618,
                0.445,
                0.637
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "二、填空题（每小题 5 分，共 20 分）"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.102,
                0.653,
                0.636,
                0.67
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "4. 函数 \\( f(x) = \\sqrt{(x - 1)} / (x - 3) \\) 的定义域为 ____.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.103,
                0.692,
                0.619,
                0.71
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "5. 已知 \\(\\sin \\theta + \\cos \\theta = 1/2\\)，则 \\(\\sin 2\\theta =\\) ____.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph_title",
            "bbox": [
                0.104,
                0.736,
                0.318,
                0.755
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "三、解答题（共60分）"
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.102,
                0.772,
                0.599,
                0.791
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "6. 已知数列 \\(\\{a_{n}\\}\\) 满足 \\(a_{1} = 1, a_{n+1} = 2a_{n} + 1 (n \\in N*)\\).",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.136,
                0.799,
                0.449,
                0.817
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "（1）证明：数列 \\(\\{a_{n} + 1\\}\\) 是等比数列；",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.137,
                0.825,
                0.376,
                0.844
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "(2) 求数列  \\( \\{a_{n}\\} \\)  的通项公式.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.104,
                0.867,
                0.449,
                0.884
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "7. 已知函数 \\( f(x) = x^3 - 3ax^2 + 3x + 1 \\).",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.136,
                0.893,
                0.68,
                0.91
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "（1）当 a = 1 时，求曲线  \\( y = f(x) \\)  在点  \\( (1, f(1)) \\)  处的切线方程；",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
        {
            "type": "text",
            "bbox": [
                0.136,
                0.917,
                0.665,
                0.935
            ],
            "angle": 0,
            "content": "（2）若 \\( f(x) \\) 在区间 \\((0, +\\infty)\\) 上单调递增，求实数 \\( a \\) 的取值范围.",
            "merge_prev": false
        },
